'''Elemental Warding''' is a [[spell]] that fires a [[Nova (projectile behaviour)|nova]] of [[projectile]]s outward, dealing spell damage. It is only available through {{il|Geofri's Devotion}} as a [[trigger]]ed skill.

==Skill mechanics and interactions==
The player must be [[curse]]d to trigger Elemental Warding. See [[self-curse]] for different methods of self-cursing; alternatively, {{il|Coward's Legacy}} has good synergy with this skill. 

You are unaffected by curses for a duration after triggering Elemental Warding.

Elemental Warding is affected by [[support gem]]s socketed into {{il|Geofri's Devotion}}, regardless of whether the [[socket]]s are linked. Since it is not an actual [[skill gem]] the effects of {{il|Empower Support}}, {{il|Enhance Support}}, and {{il|Enlighten Support}} do not apply to it. As Elemental Warding is currently only granted by Geofri's Devotion, the skill's stats at other levels are unknown.

